  "question": {
    "html": "<p>A technician measures the activity of a radioactive sample in a laboratory with a constant background radiation level. The recorded activity, which includes the contribution from background radiation, is documented in the table below for the first <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"10.0\"></span> hours of the experiment.</p>\n<table><thead><tr><th>Time / hours</th><th>Recorded activity / Bq</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"0.0\"></span></td><td><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"840\"></span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"5.0\"></span></td><td><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"440\"></span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"10.0\"></span></td><td><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"240\"></span></td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p>What is the expected recorded activity at <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"t=20.0\\ \\text{h}\"></span>?</p><ol class=\"mcq-options\"><li data-label=\"A\"><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"40\\text{ Bq}\"></span></p></li><li data-label=\"B\"><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"50\\text{ Bq}\"></span></p></li><li data-label=\"C\"><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"90\\text{ Bq}\"></span></p></li><li data-label=\"D\"><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"140\\text{ Bq}\"></span></p></li></ol>"
  },
